  "name": "Swim through the Waves",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/Water_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You control water to bear you where you wish to go.</p><p>For <strong>1 minute</strong>, you gain a <strong>Swim</strong> speed of <strong>5</strong>. If you already have a <strong>Swim</strong> speed, it increases by <strong>+5</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 minutes</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the <strong>Swim</strong> speed by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p><p>You can breathe underwater while under the effect of this spell.</p>",
